# First-party work scope

Do not edit `wp-admin/`, `wp-includes/`, or third-party plugins. A plugin on disk is not first-party unless git tracks it and the user confirmed that slug. If first-party is unconfirmed, ask which themes and plugins the agent may change. Do not infer ownership from `wp-content/plugins` alone.
